<title>MALAYSIA: PSC says eyeing substantial acquisition.</title>
<headline>PSC says eyeing substantial acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian shipbuilder and marine engineering firm PSC Industries Bhd said it was &quot;finalising the details of a substantial acquisition&quot; and will be making an announcement in due course.</p>
<p>No other details were given, with the company requesting further trading suspension for its stock.</p>
<p>PSC stock was last traded on May 2 at 30.0 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
